#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1290 expect=noViolation domain=DS
#note "At most one DSCAT='DISPOSITION EVENT' record per subject per EPOCH. Two PROTOCOL MILESTONE records in the same epoch are not disposition events; disposition events in different epochs / for different subjects are allowed."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
dataset DS class=EVENTS label="Disposition"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col DSSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DSTERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Disposition Event"
col DSDECOD type=Char label="Standardized Disposition Term"
col DSCAT   type=Char label="Category for Disposition Event"
col EPOCH   type=Char label="Epoch"
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | RANDOMIZED          | RANDOMIZED          | PROTOCOL MILESTONE | SCREENING
S1 | DS | 001 | 2 | FIRST DOSE          | OTHER               | PROTOCOL MILESTONE | SCREENING
S1 | DS | 001 | 3 | COMPLETED           | COMPLETED           | DISPOSITION EVENT  | SCREENING
S1 | DS | 001 | 4 | COMPLETED           | COMPLETED           | DISPOSITION EVENT  | TREATMENT
S1 | DS | 002 | 1 | ADVERSE EVENT       | ADVERSE EVENT       | DISPOSITION EVENT  | TREATMENT
